# i18n + theme

Before shipping strings or UI:

1. Read `.cursor/skills/wardrobe-i18n-theme/SKILL.md`
2. Put copy in `src/i18n/messages.ts` (`es` and `en`). Render with `t()`.
3. Paint chrome with `bg-canvas` / `bg-surface` / `text-ink` / `border-ink`. Ember and Sulfur keep `text-obsidian`.

Forbidden: hardcoded UI strings in JSX, a third locale, a new theme hex, page chrome using `bg-pumice` or `text-obsidian` as the canvas/ink pair.
